	(text "Discrete Blackmer VCA - 8-transistor log/antilog gain cell (after Hebert, AES preprint 4055, Fig. 4)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 35.56 20.32 0)
		(effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "ad119a88-1e9e-5ece-bbd2-acdee711a4ee"))
	(text "Gain = 0 dB at EC+ = 0 V;  control law about +5.9 mV/dB at EC+ (positive voltage increases gain), drive EC+ from a low-impedance source.\nSignal path is non-inverting:  VIN -> R1 (20k) -> gain cell -> U1B with R2 (20k).\nCore idle current about 20 uA, set by the bias generator;  R10 sets the standing current (about 2 mA)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 35.56 26.67 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "32b13308-fb1e-52b7-b71b-d1dfbf19530f"))
	(text "INPUT AMPLIFIER" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 132.08 43.18 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "b0f6a68f-667a-5e6d-9983-7c326eb7030d"))
	(text "GAIN CELL" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 213.36 43.18 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "ffc8f831-42cc-5014-8c57-5e12da808d20"))
	(text "BIAS GENERATOR" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 281.94 43.18 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "b2449994-42f1-51a2-bde0-71c39d758463"))
	(text "OUTPUT I-V CONVERTER" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 345.44 66.04 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "eb673eee-1bf1-51f4-9961-06bbc6460dd3"))
	(text "Matched pairs (one SOT-457 package each)  /  name in the SPICE model\nQ1A, Q1B  BCM847DS  log / antilog NPN       Q1, Q2\nQ2A, Q2B  BCM857DS  log / antilog PNP       Q3, Q4\nQ3A, Q3B  BCM857DS  lower correction pair   Q5, Q6\nQ4A, Q4B  BCM847DS  upper correction pair   Q7, Q8\nQ5A, Q5B  BCM857DS  bias string             D1, D2\nQ6A, Q6B  BCM847DS  bias string / shunt     D3, QS\nQ7       BC857B    bias shunt              QP" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 35.56 43.18 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "66346f47-228a-5af0-bf8b-43e5c84f6dd8"))
	(text "Trim procedure (1 kHz, measure THD at VOUT)\n1. RV1: 0 dB gain, 1 Vrms in - null distortion.\n2. RV2: -15 dB gain, 3 Vrms in - null distortion.\n3. Repeat 1 and 2 once.\n4. RV3: EC+ = 0 V - set unity gain.\nR3 / C1 set input-amplifier stability and HF distortion.\nR4-R7 (1R8) cancel transistor bulk resistance." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 35.56 78.74 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "ec0e754d-4d81-5c12-a8b4-cec927b0732a"))
